    "sections": {
        "description": "NewsEverest is a modern, responsive WordPress news and magazine theme designed for publishers, bloggers, journalists, and online magazines. With its clean layout, engaging typography, flexible homepage sections, and user-friendly design, NewsEverest makes it easy to showcase breaking news, featured stories, articles, categories, and multimedia content. Built with performance, readability, and customization in mind, it provides an ideal foundation for creating a professional and attractive news or magazine website."
